# Duplicate artefacts. This working copy lives under a synced Documents folder,
# which creates byte-identical copies named "file 2.csv" beside the original.
# Two of those reached main on 2026-09-10 via `git add -A` before this rule
# existed. The collector stages named files and directories, so it never picks
# them up -- this guards the human path.
# Any extension and any number, the same shape tools/check_junk_files.py fails a PR
# for: "automerge 12.yml", "actions-next 17.sh" and "LOOPS_OFF 9" got past the old
# single-digit list (21 Oct).
* [0-9]
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9][0-9][0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9][0-9].*
margin-data/
